Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.62,0:00:10.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I stocked up on some tools and medicines I can use.{Ep10 20:42}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:10.92,0:00:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.{Ep10 20:48}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.28,0:00:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Sakamoto, do you doubt me?{Ep10 20:51}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.30,0:00:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't survive here without mutual trust.{Ep10 21:02}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.26,0:00:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, hold on to this on the way back.{Ep10 21:14}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.52,0:00:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,It has important materials inside.{Ep10 21:21}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:32.77,0:00:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Be careful with it.{Ep10 21:24}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.33,0:00:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I will.{Ep10 21:25}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:38.30,0:00:41.35,Italics,,0,0,0,,Wh-Why's he... so intimidating?{Ep10 21:29 & 21:31}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.28,0:00:44.28,Italics,,0,0,0,,The first one to move wins.{ep10 10:04}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.28,0:00:46.61,Italics,,0,0,0,,Stay on the defensive, and you'll lose your chance.{Ep10 10:06}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:46.61,0:00:50.03,Italics,,0,0,0,,Ryouta, that is the only difference between us,{Ep10 10:09}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.03,0:00:52.57,Italics,,0,0,0,,regardless of whether you can understand that.{Ep10 10:14}
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.60,0:00:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's hurry.{Ep10 21:41}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.32,0:01:04.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouta!{Ep10 22:00?}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:06.56,0:01:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouta, get rid of the trunk!{Ep10 22:07}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.82,0:01:11.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Throw it away!{Ep10 22:11}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.09,0:01:13.76,Default,,0,0,0,,The trunk's got a BIM...{Ep10 22:18}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:14.20,0:01:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a bomb inside it!{Ep10 22:20}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.34,0:01:23.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouta!{Ep10 22:28}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.86,0:01:35.99,Default,,0,0,0,,One down!
