Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.99,0:03:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouta...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:09.45,0:03:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouta!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.73,0:03:11.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouta...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:15.19,0:03:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:17.13,0:03:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Your boyfriend's dead.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:20.73,0:03:22.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I have lots more BIMs now.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.55,0:03:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,But more importantly...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:26.65,0:03:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you figure out a BIM was in the trunk?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.73,0:03:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I actually wanted you both dead.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.27,0:03:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, whatever.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.38,0:03:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,The results won't change.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.66,0:03:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The weak exist to be devoured by the strong.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.27,0:03:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true in any endeavor.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.27,0:03:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to survive and get off this island again.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.21,0:03:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You're going to help pave my way.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.94,0:03:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Pave my way... with your corpse!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.18,0:03:59.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't changed at all, Dr. Date.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:02.68,0:04:04.72,Italics,,0,0,0,,Th-That voice...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:11.83,0:04:14.36,Italics,,0,0,0,,Sh-Shiki?!
