Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.41,0:04:26.92,B-TS,D,0,0,0,,{\pos(960.429,1034.143)\fad(0,479)\fs60\blur0.4\shad3\fsp-3\b0}10 Minutes Earlier
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.41,0:04:25.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}The medicine supply?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.41,0:04:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Yes. A giant lizard bit one of our companions.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.42,0:04:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I think he's poisoned.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.11,0:04:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't stop bleeding.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:34.84,0:04:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I was hoping we'd find some kind of serum.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:37.34,0:04:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid to say...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.72,0:04:40.93,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing like that here.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.93,0:04:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.29,0:04:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But there {\i1}are{\i0} painkillers and antibiotics.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.64,0:04:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Come with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.88,0:04:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll show you the way.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.95,0:04:52.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Three of us are here.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:52.12,0:04:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But I don't trust one of them.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:54.70,0:04:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, why are you with them?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:57.29,0:04:58.68,Default,,0,0,0,,W-Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.41,0:05:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The medicine is in the room through that window.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:05.41,0:05:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Date.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:06.97,0:05:08.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the man we're...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.84,0:05:13.92,Italics,,0,0,0,,Th-That's definitely him.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.01,0:05:16.36,Italics,,0,0,0,,That's Dr. Date!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.77,0:05:22.86,Italics,,0,0,0,,Why is he on this island again?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.77,0:05:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.89,0:05:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:29.87,0:05:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That's him.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.63,0:05:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The one who did this to me...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.63,0:05:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Date Masahito.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:39.01,0:05:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,It was that man.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:41.29,0:05:43.87,Italics,,0,0,0,,That's him? Mr. Date did that?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.24,0:05:47.88,Italics,,0,0,0,,He's the one who betrayed Ms. Murasaki to escape this island?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:48.37,0:05:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of BIMs does he have right now?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.91,0:05:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The remote controlled type.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.35,0:05:55.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Remote controlled...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.99,0:06:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen, there's no doubt that he'll betray you.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:00.83,0:06:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The only question is when.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:06.10,0:06:07.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouta...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:08.29,0:06:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:09.83,0:06:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,He's planted a remote controlled BIM in that trunk for sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:14.01,0:06:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He's used that trick before.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.32,0:06:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:21.19,0:06:21.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Himiko!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.24,0:06:26.74,Italics,,0,0,0,,No, Ryouta!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:28.45,0:06:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouta, get rid of the trunk!{1:04}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:30.66,0:06:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry! Throw it away!{1:07}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.37,0:06:34.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The trunk's got a BIM...{1:09}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.00,0:06:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a bomb inside it!{1:12}
Dialogue: 10,0:06:38.49,0:06:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Himiko!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.42,0:06:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Himiko!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:41.56,0:06:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Himiko?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.02,0:06:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouta...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.45,0:06:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouta was...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.18,0:06:46.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:46.36,0:06:47.44,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to run!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.65,0:06:54.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're still alive, Shiki.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:56.71,0:06:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouta... Ryouta...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:58.52,0:06:59.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.23,0:07:02.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter where you run.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.28,0:07:03.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I've already planted BIMs.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:03.99,0:07:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this one!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:10.31,0:07:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He planted BIMs ahead of time.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.24,0:07:14.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They're probably all over this building.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.17,0:07:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going outside.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.17,0:07:25.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. Over here.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.56,0:07:27.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like my timing was off.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.89,0:07:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Been a while, hasn't it, Shiki?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.78,0:07:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I never thought you'd still be alive.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:34.39,0:07:37.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you patch up your missing arm yourself?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.64,0:07:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,That took guts.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.53,0:07:41.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me applaud you.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.65,0:07:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And I never thought I'd see you back here.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.88,0:07:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You made it out once,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.42,0:07:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but you must've pissed someone off again.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.00,0:07:51.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd pity you if it weren't so funny.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.16,0:07:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say, you bitch?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:53.95,0:07:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You probably planted your remote controlled bombs all over this area, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.33,0:08:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I decided I'd make my stand here.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.09,0:08:06.22,Default,,0,0,0,,So I placed all my remote controlled bombs in this area.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.59,0:08:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I know exactly where each BIM is.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.01,0:08:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If you try to run, I'll definitely kill you this time!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.29,0:08:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.84,0:08:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the little girl all ready to give up?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.54,0:08:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I can understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.94,0:08:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Her boyfriend {\i1}was{\i0} killed right in front of her.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.61,0:08:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.52,0:08:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll be seeing him soon.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:29.27,0:08:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to {\i1}his{\i0} BIMs.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.24,0:08:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't let that happen!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.83,0:08:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You let your guard down!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:39.80,0:08:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,If she presses the switch,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.71,0:08:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I can fight, too!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.13,0:08:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it's two against one.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.83,0:08:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder who's at the disadvantage here.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.93,0:08:54.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I never forgot you... not for an instant.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.85,0:08:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Back then, I cursed myself.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:58.85,0:09:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I was a fool.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:01.61,0:09:03.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I was ignorant.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.61,0:09:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,And I was stupid enough
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.69,0:09:08.11,Default,,0,0,0,,to put my faith in love.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.65,0:09:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you think God must have brought us together again?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.78,0:09:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,S-Stay away.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.58,0:09:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep away from me!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:18.42,0:09:19.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:22.75,0:09:24.05,Italics,,0,0,0,,You fell for it.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.97,0:09:29.63,Italics,,0,0,0,,Th-The other side of the wall?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:39.56,0:09:41.60,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.45,0:09:50.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You should've stayed dead the first time.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.43,0:09:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, the only one left is that stupid school girl who can't fight.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.89,0:09:57.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Once I kill her, I'll take their two chips,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.86,0:10:00.83,Default,,0,0,0,,plus the three they collected.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:01.25,0:10:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Head back, kill the cripple, and I'll have six.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:05.17,0:10:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all I need.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.34,0:10:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This is too easy.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:11.75,0:10:12.94,Italics,,0,0,0,,He's coming.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.94,0:10:14.18,Italics,,0,0,0,,He's coming for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.09,0:10:17.27,Italics,,0,0,0,,I have to run.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:20.37,0:10:21.50,Italics,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.03,0:10:24.36,Italics,,0,0,0,,I'm surrounded by BIMs.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.15,0:10:26.73,Italics,,0,0,0,,I have to fight.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.09,0:10:31.66,Italics,,0,0,0,,But I'm on my own. How can I?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:36.83,0:10:40.06,Italics,,0,0,0,,I'm going... to die here.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:41.73,0:10:44.63,Italics,,0,0,0,,And just when I'd started to think I actually didn't want to...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.51,0:10:49.46,Italics,,0,0,0,,and that I was ready to give it my all.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.75,0:10:51.70,Italics,,0,0,0,,Without Ryouta...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.76,0:10:54.43,Italics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,441)}Without Ryouta here...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.23,0:10:59.28,Italics,,0,0,0,,When I was fed up with reality and escaped to the world of the game,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:59.28,0:11:01.48,Italics,,0,0,0,,he always cheered me up.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:02.06,0:11:04.40,Italics,,0,0,0,,He's always been there for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.37,0:11:06.44,Italics,,0,0,0,,If I'd known...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.44,0:11:08.02,Italics,,0,0,0,,If I'd known this was going to happen...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:09.93,0:11:13.11,Italics,,0,0,0,,I should've just told him I was Himiko!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.93,0:11:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Himiko, was it?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.73,0:11:18.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you one last chance.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.40,0:11:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you join me?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.41,0:11:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a veteran.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.64,0:11:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We can get all the chips we need and go home.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:25.77,0:11:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:26.78,0:11:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't sound so bad, does it?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.89,0:11:32.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Liar!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.94,0:11:35.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's how you deceived Ms. Murasaki!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.11,0:11:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.68,0:11:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,So you know...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.68,0:11:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, just die!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.21,0:11:44.06,Italics,,0,0,0,,This is for the best.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.07,0:11:48.94,Italics,,0,0,0,,At least I can die... with dignity.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:50.23,0:11:52.78,Italics,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Mother.{BOING!!!}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:04.51,0:12:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:05.46,0:12:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't it explode?!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.67,0:12:11.18,Italics,,0,0,0,,The detonator won't activate.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.18,0:12:14.17,Italics,,0,0,0,,Does that mean I don't have the right to use it?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.01,0:12:17.58,Italics,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.31,0:12:24.02,Italics,,0,0,0,,H-He's...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.01,0:12:26.34,Italics,,0,0,0,,He's...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:31.13,0:12:33.07,Italics,,0,0,0,,still alive?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:33.73,0:12:37.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it was, Mr. Date?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.07,0:12:39.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Good God, you're low.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.49,0:12:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Himiko?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:43.14,0:12:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Ryouta?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:45.71,0:12:47.36,Default,,0,0,0,,H-How?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.36,0:12:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How did you survive that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.42,0:12:56.17,B-TS,S,0,0,0,,{\pos(960.429,1034.143)\fs60\blur0.6\shad3\fsp-3}5 Minutes Earlier
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.42,0:12:55.34,Default,,0,0,9,,{\an8}Ryouta, get rid of the trunk!{1:04}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.34,0:12:57.10,Default,,0,0,9,,{\an8}Hurry! Throw it away!{1:07}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.10,0:12:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,The trunk's got a BIM...{1:09}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:58.55,0:13:00.55,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a bomb inside it!{1:12}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.95,0:13:17.68,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Ryouta, I...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.68,0:13:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought you were dead.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:21.65,0:13:22.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.84,0:13:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,For a minute, so did I.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:27.15,0:13:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It almost feels like something is keeping me alive.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.15,0:13:35.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I've learned my lesson now.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:35.97,0:13:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What {\i1}has{\i0} died, is my naïvety.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.31,0:13:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Date...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.32,0:13:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No... Date!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.29,0:13:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as I'm alive, the only BIMs you can use are your remote controlled type.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.91,0:13:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,And you've planted all of them in this area.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.38,0:13:55.86,Default,,0,0,0,,But that means that, right now, you're totally unarmed.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:56.41,0:13:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got one BIM, a cracker,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.86,0:14:03.11,Default,,0,0,0,,and Himiko is fully armed.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:03.49,0:14:05.36,Default,,0,0,0,,This fight is over.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:05.36,0:14:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Give up and admit defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.25,0:14:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Or...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.17,0:14:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Or I'll kill you right here!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:15.47,0:14:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait... Wait, Date!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.99,0:14:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay away!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.58,0:14:22.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me go!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.13,0:14:25.21,Italics,,0,0,0,,I can't believe he's not dead!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:25.21,0:14:26.68,Italics,,0,0,0,,I should've made sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:26.68,0:14:27.89,Italics,,0,0,0,,Crap! Crap!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:35.11,0:14:37.44,Italics,,0,0,0,,That's right, come on!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:37.44,0:14:39.04,Italics,,0,0,0,,Come after me!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:39.04,0:14:40.40,Italics,,0,0,0,,I'm unarmed.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.40,0:14:42.78,Italics,,0,0,0,,You have the advantage.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.78,0:14:45.03,Italics,,0,0,0,,You can't lose.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.87,0:14:47.86,Italics,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.86,0:14:49.40,Italics,,0,0,0,,Just relax...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:49.40,0:14:50.79,Italics,,0,0,0,,Lower your guard.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.79,0:14:53.04,Italics,,0,0,0,,Chase me as I run!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:54.73,0:14:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Date!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.13,0:14:57.29,Italics,,0,0,0,,Dumbass!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.77,0:15:00.69,Italics,,0,0,0,,I hid a BIM under those boards.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:00.69,0:15:04.05,Italics,,0,0,0,,I'll show you what a veteran is capable of.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.57,0:15:05.72,Italics,,0,0,0,,Die!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.67,0:15:08.68,Italics,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:09.22,0:15:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,While you were chasing Himiko, I found a BIM that you set
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.73,0:15:15.62,Default,,0,0,0,,in the only place nearby to hide one.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:16.89,0:15:18.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So, I moved it.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:27.75,0:15:28.99,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Ryouta!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.27,0:15:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouta, what will you do with him?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.45,0:15:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to kill him.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.39,0:15:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,He kept trying to kill me until the very end.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:43.37,0:15:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He only got close to us because he wanted our chips.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.65,0:15:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't stay with him.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.51,0:15:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,And look at him.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:51.71,0:15:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't survive on this island.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:55.13,0:15:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.83,0:15:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Murasaki!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.05,0:16:01.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You survived?!{No, fuckwit. Clearly she's a ghost}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:01.73,0:16:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't just kill me off like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:03.80,0:16:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fine, as you can see.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.53,0:16:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to dirty your hands.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.37,0:16:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,This was always between the two of us.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:15.35,0:16:17.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiki...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.33,0:16:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,H-Help... me...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.20,0:16:22.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Sh-Shiki...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:22.38,0:16:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You're pathetic.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.24,0:16:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,At least die like a man.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.88,0:16:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You've always been this way, looking down on people... using them...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.20,0:16:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Tossing them aside like garbage when they outlived their usefulness.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.11,0:16:36.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're dishonest.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:37.51,0:16:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a disgusting man!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:40.23,0:16:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give you your judgment.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:51.32,0:16:53.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I-I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.27,0:16:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop that.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:00.23,0:17:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stop it.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.93,0:17:04.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.67,0:17:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't look at me like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.49,0:17:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just not fair...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:26.23,0:17:30.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You'll forgive me?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:30.74,0:17:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forgive you.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:32.92,0:17:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Not someone like you!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:35.93,0:17:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:38.57,0:17:40.25,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way I can...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:06.79,0:18:09.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No peeking, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.19,0:18:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:11.89,0:18:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just there as my bodyguard.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:15.51,0:18:17.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I know that, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.47,0:18:20.48,Default,,0,0,0,,But you know, I don't get it.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.48,0:18:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Get what?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.66,0:18:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Murasaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.90,0:18:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't he do something terrible to her in the last game?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:28.47,0:18:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, she saved him.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:31.53,0:18:34.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand how adults think.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.16,0:18:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouta, aren't {\i1}you{\i0} an adult?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.95,0:18:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I never grew up because I was a NEET.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:45.17,0:18:47.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I think... that I understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.89,0:18:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.75,0:18:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little, though.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:55.33,0:18:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:59.57,0:19:01.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe you have to be a woman to understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:01.83,0:19:03.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe so.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.27,0:19:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to get the medicine Ms. Murasaki gave us to Mr. Taira.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.81,0:19:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Himiko, I've got a suggestion.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.78,0:19:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.54,0:19:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to pick up some chips on our way back.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.22,0:19:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,We've seen bodies here that we haven't checked for chips, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.47,0:19:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That Akechi guy who attacked you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.81,0:19:30.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The father of that crazy kid I met.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:31.36,0:19:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And the guy with the buzz cut I fought at the start.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.19,0:19:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to get them before anyone else.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.07,0:19:43.58,Default,,0,0,0,,But with the ones we have, that will only give us six.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.58,0:19:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll still be one short.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.86,0:19:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,That first guy I saw had two BIM pouches.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.51,0:19:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Which means he should have two chips.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.61,0:19:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That would make seven.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:55.32,0:19:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We could use them to bring a helicopter.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.19,0:20:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,We hijack the helicopter, and everyone gets off the island!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.95,0:20:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't have to fight anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.97,0:20:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.07,0:20:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We won't have to kill anyone, will we?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.13,0:20:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.75,0:20:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouta, you perv!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:20.24,0:20:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Jerk! Pervert!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.90,0:20:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-You're the one who came out of the shower!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.38,0:20:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You Peeping Tom!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.48,0:20:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew I couldn't trust men!
Dialogue: 1,0:20:41.65,0:20:48.70,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)\blur1.5}I hold my breath and close my eyes
