Dialogue: 10,0:22:14.47,0:22:17.51,Default,,0,0,0,,No good. There's no chip here, either.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:17.51,0:22:19.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's taken it.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:19.99,0:22:22.49,Default,,0,0,0,,We checked all three, and to think there's none...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:24.93,0:22:25.84,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:26.63,0:22:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you thinking about that Akechi guy?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:31.95,0:22:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're blaming yourself, I don't think you should.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:36.79,0:22:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was self-defense.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:39.19,0:22:43.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You were dragged to this island and forced to play this weird game.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:43.55,0:22:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It isn't your fault.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:45.68,0:22:47.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the fault of those behind this.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:47.18,0:22:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And his, for losing control of himself!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:56.31,0:22:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's head back.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:57.73,0:22:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:02.45,0:23:03.62,Italics,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:03.62,0:23:08.10,Italics,,0,0,0,,Once or twice would mean another player had stumbled upon the body...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:08.10,0:23:09.68,Italics,,0,0,0,,but all three?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:10.83,0:23:14.50,Italics,,0,0,0,,The only one who knew about that chip was...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:15.91,0:23:18.20,Italics,,0,0,0,,No way. That can't be.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:18.20,0:23:20.25,Italics,,0,0,0,,No, it couldn't be...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:20.69,0:23:23.42,Italics,,0,0,0,,Seems to me like you're satisfied with holding yourself back.{Ep10 9:56}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:23.42,0:23:26.14,Italics,,0,0,0,,To me, you're like a gullible little kid.{Ep10 10:00}
Dialogue: 10,0:23:26.89,0:23:28.84,Italics,,0,0,0,,I stopped being like that!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:30.19,0:23:31.80,Italics,,0,0,0,,We're all going to survive this.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:34.09,0:23:36.88,Italics,,0,0,0,,And we'll leave the island together.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:36.88,0:23:38.65,Italics,,0,0,0,,Won't we, Mr. Taira?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:39.59,0:23:41.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this fog.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:41.30,0:23:43.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad we made it back.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:43.46,0:23:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Mr. Taira's worried.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:49.45,0:23:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:23:51.06,0:23:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Shh.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:52.00,0:23:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear something.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:57.89,0:23:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,That sound...
Dialogue: 10,0:23:59.00,0:24:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,A homing type?
Dialogue: 10,0:24:00.50,0:24:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Ryouta!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:02.29,0:24:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The only person with this type of BIM...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:04.80,0:24:05.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:08.85,0:24:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't tell where we'll go back to...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:10.38,0:24:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,...or what'll happen in the future.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:11.82,0:24:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, you were there...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:12.80,0:24:14.51,Default,,0,0,0,,...there for me.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.51,0:24:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You are hope...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:15.84,0:24:17.10,Default,,0,0,0,,...my hope.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:17.10,0:24:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And in this hellish place...
Dialogue: 10,0:24:18.95,0:24:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,...we'll survive, together.
